id: powerful-technique
name: Powerful Technique
talentCategory: technique
prerequisites: Favored Technique
description: >
  Your Favored Technique has become truly powerful, leaving others in awe of its might.
text: >
  Powerful Technique: Your Favored Technique has become truly powerful, leaving others in awe of its might.
  –Prerequisites: Favored Technique
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Favored Technique by 1(T) for each Health Threshold you are below.
  (2)-[Passive]: If your Favored Technique is an Ultimate Signature, increase your Wound Roll for that Attacking Maneuver by 1(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: Your Favored Technique gains an Advantage depending on if they are a Super or Ultimate Signature (if your Favored Technique already possesses that Advantage, refund any Technique Points spent and reduce the TP Cost of your Favored Technique accordingly):
  * Super Signature: Your Favored Technique gains the Ascended Signature Advantage.
  * Ultimate Signature: Your Favored Technique gains the Maximum Charge Advantage.

---

[passive]
# (1), (2) Added to the Favored Technique's Wound as it is declared - not on another Profile through Flexible Technique (2):
# 1(T) for each Health Threshold you are below, and 1(T) more where it is an Ultimate (use-maneuver.mjs
# askTechniqueDeclaration).
allow powerful.technique;
# (3) Read by the Technique itself off this Talent: Ascended Signature on a Super, Maximum Charge on an Ultimate - no TP for
# it; bought already, its TP given back (item-maneuver.mjs powerfulAdvantage; technique.mjs techniqueTP).
